      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The in-memory cache was never the mistake. An engineer defended it directly when asked why not\njust query the DB on every check: it would raise DB load on every token refresh and tie gateway\nuptime to the database's, exactly when a deploy or spike is the worst time for that coupling.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The in-memory cache was never the mistake. An engineer defended it directly when asked why not\njust query the DB on every check: it would raise DB load on every token refresh and tie gateway\nuptime to the database's, exactly when a deploy or spike is the worst time for that coupling.",
      "lineHeight": 1.3
    },
